# Request
# A detected position (e.g. from a VisionStep's locate_part result) to
# match against the live poses of currently-spawned catalog instances.
# Orientation deliberately omitted — disambiguating WHICH instance this
# is (including stacked-object cases) only needs position; matching
# orientation too would reject correct matches whenever the object had
# settled/rotated slightly after being placed.
float64  x
float64  y
float64  z
float64  max_distance   # meters — reject the match if the nearest known
                         # instance is farther than this. Required, not
                         # defaulted, so callers make a deliberate choice
                         # given their object spacing (this is exactly
                         # the "stacked objects" scenario from earlier —
                         # too generous a threshold risks matching the
                         # wrong instance).

---
# Response
bool     success
string   child_model    # empty on failure
string   child_link      # empty on failure
float64  distance        # actual distance to the matched instance, meters
string   message